  "question": {
    "text": "Tangents are drawn from any point on the directrix of <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>x</mi></math> to the parabola. If the locus of the midpoint of chords of contact is a parabola, then its length (in units) of the latus rectum is",
